WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Everyone is playing the same game. But everyone has a different Secret Rule.

00:05.000 --> 00:10.000
Get four to ten friends together, create a room, and share the code.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.000
At the start of each round, everyone gets five private cards.

00:15.000 --> 00:20.000
You also get a Secret objective. Only you can see it.

00:20.000 --> 00:25.000
On your turn, choose the card you're really playing.

00:25.000 --> 00:31.000
Then tell everyone what you claim you played. Tell the truth... or lie.

00:31.000 --> 00:36.000
Before time runs out, another player can Call Bluff.

00:36.000 --> 00:43.000
If they catch your lie, your card is cancelled, they gain a point,
and you lose a point and another card.

00:43.000 --> 00:48.000
But challenge someone who's telling the truth,
and you're the one who gets punished.

00:48.000 --> 00:56.000
Special cards let you steal, skip, inspect, reverse,
protect yourself, or change the Button.

00:56.000 --> 00:62.000
Manipulate the Button and land exactly on the target.

00:62.000 --> 00:68.000
Complete your Secret without giving yourself away for bonus points.

00:68.000 --> 00:75.000
Bluff. Accuse. Manipulate. Score the most points to win.
